#1633-2631 
Special way of organizzing data, (putting new stuff on the top. Taking out stuff from the top.)

***LIFO**
Last In First Out

***Operations***
1) Insert (Only at the top) -> push(...)
2) Delete (Only at the top) -> pop(...)
3) Check if stack is full -> isFull(...)  
4) Check if stack is full -> isEmpty(...)
5) Create new empty stack
6) GetTop() -> Get top elements value

```c++
if (!object.isFull()) {
	object.push(item);
}
if (!object.isEmpty()) {
	object.pop(item);
}
```

